What usually fits: preset='large_n_gpu' with leaf_size=256 keeps the fast-lane payload and the near-field neighbour buffer bounded (it is the path built for this N); raising leaf_size shrinks num_leaves and every per-leaf buffer with it, at some accuracy cost. To change ONE traversal capacity without disturbing the preset's other tuning, pass jaccpot.TraversalOverrides(...) rather than a full DualTreeTraversalConfig.
